<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="yGfR1qkc9pjWKkHJBVqI">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2409" dy="2021" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle HR Manager - Use Case Diagram\n\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; ==================== VISUAL STYLE ====================\n\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC\n\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\nskinparam packageBorderColor #4F6D8A\nskinparam packageFontColor #1E293B\nskinparam packageFontStyle bold\nskinparam packageFontSize 14\n\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor #64748B\nskinparam usecaseFontColor #0F172A\nskinparam usecaseFontSize 13\n\nskinparam actorBorderColor #2563EB\nskinparam actorFontColor #1E3A8A\n\nskinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DB\nskinparam noteBorderColor #D6A700\n\nskinparam ArrowColor #475569\nskinparam ArrowFontColor #334155\n\nskinparam roundcorner 14\nskinparam nodesep 30\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam PackagePadding 18\n\nskinparam TitleFontSize 18\nskinparam TitleFontStyle bold\n\n&#39; ==================== ACTOR ====================\n\nactor \&quot;HR Manager\&quot; as Manager\n\n&#39; ==================== SYSTEM BOUNDARY ====================\n\nrectangle \&quot;HR Management &amp; Supervision Module\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; ==================== LEAVE SUPERVISION ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Leave Request Supervision\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Review Leave Requests\&quot; as UC01\n\n        usecase \&quot;Approve Leave Request\&quot; as UC02\n        usecase \&quot;Reject Leave Request\&quot; as UC03\n\n        usecase \&quot;Monitor Employee Leave Balances\&quot; as UC04\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== PAYROLL SUPERVISION ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Payroll Supervision\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Review Monthly Payroll\&quot; as UC05\n        usecase \&quot;Review Payroll History\&quot; as UC06\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== RECRUITMENT SUPERVISION ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Recruitment Supervision\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Review AI Screening Results\&quot; as UC07\n        usecase \&quot;Evaluate Candidate Rankings\&quot; as UC08\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== EMPLOYEE RECORDS ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Employee Records Management\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;View Employee Records\&quot; as UC10\n        usecase \&quot;Create Employee Record\&quot; as UC11\n        usecase \&quot;Update Employee Record\&quot; as UC12\n        usecase \&quot;Soft Delete Employee Record\&quot; as UC18\n\n        usecase \&quot;Manage Employee Documents\&quot; as UC13\nusecase \&quot;Link Legal Employment Contracts\&quot; as UC30\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Employee Record Data\&quot; as UC14\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Employee Deletion\&quot; as UC19\n    }\n\n    &#39; ==================== EMPLOYEE STATUS ====================\n\n    package \&quot;Employee Status Management\&quot; {\n\n        usecase \&quot;Activate Employee Status\&quot; as UC15\n        usecase \&quot;Deactivate Employee Status\&quot; as UC16\n\n        usecase \&quot;Validate Employee Status Transition\&quot; as UC17\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; ==================== LAYOUT HINTS ====================\n\nUC01 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC02\nUC02 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC03\nUC03 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC04\n\nUC05 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC06\n\nUC07 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC08\n\nUC10 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC11\nUC11 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC12\nUC12 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC18\nUC18 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC13\nUC13 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC14\n\nUC15 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC16\nUC16 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC17\n\n&#39; Package Alignment\nUC01 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC05\nUC01 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC07\nUC05 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC10\nUC08 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC13\n\nUC13 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC15\n\nUC04 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC06\nUC14 -[hidden]right-&gt; UC19\n\n&#39; ==================== ACTOR ASSOCIATIONS ====================\n\nManager --&gt; UC01\nManager --&gt; UC04\n\nManager --&gt; UC05\nManager --&gt; UC06\n\nManager --&gt; UC07\nManager --&gt; UC08\n\nManager --&gt; UC10\nManager --&gt; UC11\nManager --&gt; UC12\nManager --&gt; UC13\nManager --&gt; UC18\n\nManager --&gt; UC15\nManager --&gt; UC16\n\n&#39; ==================== LEAVE DECISION RELATIONSHIPS ====================\n\nUC02 ..&gt; UC01 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC03 ..&gt; UC01 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\nnote right of UC02\n  An approved leave request\n  updates the employee&#39;s\n  leave balance.\nend note\n\n&#39; ==================== EMPLOYEE RECORD VALIDATION ====================\n\nUC11 ..&gt; UC14 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC12 ..&gt; UC14 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nnote right of UC14\n  Checks employee record data\n  before saving or updating.\nend note\nUC30 ..&gt; UC13 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n&#39; ==================== EMPLOYEE SOFT DELETE ====================\n\nUC18 ..&gt; UC19 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nnote right of UC19\n  Checks that the employee record\n  exists and has not already been\n  soft-deleted.\n\n  Employee data and related\n  history must be retained.\nend note\n\n&#39; ==================== EMPLOYEE STATUS VALIDATION ====================\n\nUC15 ..&gt; UC17 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC16 ..&gt; UC17 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nnote right of UC17\n  Checks the employee&#39;s current\n  status before applying\n  the requested status change.\nend note\n\n&#39; ==================== RECRUITMENT RELATIONSHIPS ====================\n\nUC08 ..&gt; UC07 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nnote bottom of UC08\n  Candidate rankings support\n  HR evaluation. Final hiring\n  decisions remain subject\n  to human review.\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="JKjf_IJZwSzQ-70NxJAM-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10 10 533 10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
